  "description": "ELAHEF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C210 H195 O45 Tb5,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.565-5.163 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.11-160.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb5(OH)5(abzm)10]·4C7H8 (C238H227O45Tb5; bulk desolvated C210H195O45Tb5). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
